# Everything here runs inside a Linux container. Checking any of it out with
# CRLF endings breaks the entrypoint with "bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M", so
# line endings are pinned to LF regardless of the platform cloning the repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary

# Test fixtures. `text=auto` above would guess, and a guess that goes wrong
# rewrites bytes inside an audio file.
*.mp3 binary
